/description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:14:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/diabetes-may-change-key-mitochondrial-signals-in-alzheimers-disease</guid></item><item><title>基于光的方法能够精确控制扫描隧道显微镜中的超快电子流</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/light-based-method-enables-precise-control-of-ultrafast-electron-flow-in-a-scanning-tunneling-microscope</link><description>这项研究由以色列理工学院物理学院的迈克尔·克鲁格 (Michael Krüger) 领导&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:59:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/light-based-method-enables-precise-control-of-ultrafast-electron-flow-in-a-scanning-tunneling-microscope</guid></item><item><title>ALMA发现“龙蛋”可能代表大质量恒星形成的最早阶段</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/alma-spots-dragon-egg-that-may-represent-the-earliest-stages-of-massive-star-formation</link><description>质量是太阳八倍的巨星是如何形成的，仍然是科学界争论的焦点。主要有两个想法。有人说，浓密的气体云首先凝结成一个巨大的“前恒星”核心，然后坍缩形成一颗巨星。另一种说法是，恒星一开始很小，然后通过从周围较大的团块中吸收物质来生长。&lt;img src="https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.07138" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:44:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/alma-spots-dragon-egg-that-may-represent-the-earliest-stages-of-massive-star-formation</guid></item><item><title>DNA 编程了一种无细胞材料来构建自己的马达并移动</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/dna-programs-a-cell-free-material-to-build-its-own-motors-and-move</link><description>驱动这些转变的指令内置于材料本身——DNA 中。改变基因程序使细丝维持流动运动，在爆发活动后停止或反复加速和减速。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:29:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/dna-programs-a-cell-free-material-to-build-its-own-motors-and-move</guid></item><item><title>实验表明量子“猫”态何时停止反弹</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/experiment-shows-when-quantum-cat-states-stop-bouncing-back</link><description>这两个组成部分可以干扰、增强或抵消彼此对测量结果概率的贡献。这种干涉将叠加与微波场完全空或包含光的情况区分开来。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:14:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/experiment-shows-when-quantum-cat-states-stop-bouncing-back</guid></item><item><title>计算磁通量量子提供了测量光子数的新方法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/counting-magnetic-flux-quanta-offers-new-way-to-measure-photon-numbers</link><description>检测单个光子是光子量子计算机和量子通信的关键技术，已经提出了多种方法。虽然其中一些方法已经用于研究目的的实际应用，但它们与工业应用的整合才刚刚开始。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:59:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/counting-magnetic-flux-quanta-offers-new-way-to-measure-photon-numbers</guid></item><item><title>化学修饰的糖可以直接形成纳米结构</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/chemically-modified-sugars-enable-direct-nanostructure-formation</link><description>纳米多孔碳质材料作为有助于解决能源相关挑战的材料而引起人们的关注，并具有作为二次电池的催化剂载体和电极材料的潜在应用。特别是，具有高度均匀孔径和形状、可针对特定应用定制的碳质材料的需求不断增加。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:44:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/chemically-modified-sugars-enable-direct-nanostructure-formation</guid></item></channel></rss>